diff --git a/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/sol-s12-canonical-report.md b/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/sol-s12-canonical-report.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..c1d1d3758ebd4a520fab2a2ece89e17c61c832a8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/sol-s12-canonical-report.md
@@ -0,0 +1,90 @@
+**干了什么**　把发布闸切到短域唯一。只刷新主域四个地址，独立验真 `www` 的永久跳转和两个退役入口。  
+**PI 怎么亲手验**　打开下方 `deploy.json`，按 Ctrl+F 搜索 `?from=www HTTP=301 Location=https://thoradar.online/?from=www`，看到查询参数随跳转保留即可。  
+**还剩什么坑**　截至 2026-11-28 20:08，M3 公网回读报告尚未送达。生产放行仍待 M3 和 R2 独立复核。
+
+# T1128-SMOOTH-S12 交付报告
+
+席位 `codex-gpt`，Run `model=gpt-6.2-sol`，签发为 2026-11-28 G18。隔离工作树位于 `.git/t1128-s12-worktree`，基底是 `af3f2775855bb99aeb5c3262cb2738a889b60d70` 加主树现有 S7 三文件差异。补丁以该 S7 状态为应用基线。旧 S11 补丁未纳入。
+
+## 结论与改动清单
+
+- `.github/workflows/deploy_oss.yml` 保留现有 OSS 逐件上传、worker `no-store`、首页最后上传的顺序。正常发布使用 `sw.js`，主域退役发布在 `/sw.js` 放 `sw-retire.js`。刷新命令只提交主域 `/`、`/index.html`、`/sw.js`、`/sw-retire.js`。
+- 发布后用公网 HEAD 响应验真。主域四件均须 `200` 且 `Content-MD5` 匹配本次 Git 文件。`www` 的 `/`、`/index.html`、`/?from=www` 必须返回 `301` 或 `308` 和精确的短域同路径、同查询 `Location`。`www` 两 worker 直接响应 `200`，两种发布模式均以退役文件的 `Content-MD5` 验收。两域 worker 同查 JavaScript MIME 和 `no-store`。`Publish verified on both domains` 在上述九次检查都成功后输出。
+- `tests/smooth/verify-deploy.mjs` 与 `tests/smooth/deploy-mock.mjs` 模拟两种发布、跳转、旧 worker 退出、刷新和上传故障。正常与退役各断言恰好一次刷新请求，参数仅含主域四地址。短域 `/sw.js` 在六分钟传播场景中第 12 次验证才成功，模拟等待为两次 5 秒、九次 40 秒，共 370 秒。
+- `docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/release-contract.md` 落定 G18 验收模型。双域源站预检仍逐验 SNI 和 `200`，公网结果由独立检查决定。
+
+[完整增量补丁](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/sol-s12-canonical.patch)
+
+## 本地验证
+
+在隔离工作树用 Node v24.14.0 和 Git Bash 跑完整发布模拟。原始输出如下。
+
+```powershell
+$ev = 'docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12'
+node tests/smooth/verify-deploy.mjs "$ev/deploy.json"
+# SUMMARY {"passed":27,"failed":0}
+# exit=0
+node tests/smooth/verify-deploy.mjs "$ev/baseline-s7.json" "$ev/baseline-s7.yml"
+# SUMMARY {"passed":10,"failed":17}
+# exit=1
+```
+
+S7 在新模拟中把 `www` 根路径的永久跳转当成对象验真失败。S12 在两种发布模式都跑通，查询样本的原始输出如下。
+
+```text
+Verified https://www.thoradar.online/?from=www HTTP=301 Location=https://thoradar.online/?from=www
+Publish verified on both domains
+```
+
+完整输出与命令跟踪见 [deploy.json](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/deploy.json)、[stdout](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/deploy.stdout.txt)、[stderr](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/deploy.stderr.txt)、[exit](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/deploy.exit.txt)、[S7 基线 JSON](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/baseline-s7.json) 和 [S7 stderr](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/baseline-s7.stderr.txt)。
+
+### 负对照
+
+每组在独立的 YAML 副本撤防后跑同一套测试。各组 `summary.json` 包含准确的替换内容、实际命令、套件退出码和场景退出码。同目录留有候选 YAML 与完整 stdout、stderr、JSON。
+
+```powershell
+$runner = 'docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/run-mutations.mjs'
+node $runner www-refresh www-ignore-location
+node $runner www-allow-200 www-use-active-worker
+node $runner www-allow-302 remove-md5-guard short-wait
+```
+
+| 撤防 | 测试汇总 | 失败断言 |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| [www-refresh](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/www-refresh/summary.json) | 25 通过，2 失败，退出 1 | 正常与退役的刷新地址精确断言 |
+| [www-allow-200](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/www-allow-200/summary.json) | 25 通过，2 失败，退出 1 | `www-root-200` 和 `www-index-200` |
+| [www-allow-302](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/www-allow-302/summary.json) | 26 通过，1 失败，退出 1 | `www-redirect-302` |
+| [www-ignore-location](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/www-ignore-location/summary.json) | 25 通过，2 失败，退出 1 | `www-redirect-wrong-location` 和 `www-redirect-lost-query` |
+| [www-use-active-worker](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/www-use-active-worker/summary.json) | 21 通过，6 失败，退出 1 | 包括 `www-active-worker` |
+| [remove-md5-guard](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/remove-md5-guard/summary.json) | 23 通过，4 失败，退出 1 | 包括 `wrong-md5` |
+| [short-wait](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/short-wait/summary.json) | 26 通过，1 失败，退出 1 | 六分钟传播场景 |
+
+撤掉 MD5 检查后，`wrong-md5-retire` 的发布模拟由退出 `1` 变为 `0`，套件准确报 `FAIL post-publish verification rejects wrong-md5: deployment exited 0`。正本另将 `www /sw.js` 误回正常 worker、HTML 或跳转均判红。汇总见 [mutation-summary.json](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/mutation-summary.json)。
+
+### 补丁与产品不变量
+
+```powershell
+$wt = '.git/t1128-s12-worktree'
+$patch = "$wt/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/sol-s12-canonical.patch"
+git -C $wt diff --check
+# exit=0
+git diff --check
+# exit=0
+git apply --check --whitespace=error $patch
+# exit=0
+git diff HEAD --exit-code -- index.html sw.js sw-retire.js
+# exit=0
+git -C $wt diff HEAD --exit-code -- index.html sw.js sw-retire.js
+# exit=0
+```
+
+两树的三件产品 Git blob 都与 HEAD 一致。Windows 主树的两件 worker 为 LF，隔离树检出为 CRLF，首次原始 SHA-256 对比在 `sw.js` 出现差异。通过 `git ls-files --eol` 定位换行差异，再用 `git hash-object --path` 核实三件 Git blob 一致。Git 原件的 `sw.js` MD5 为 `nrgKbeazqBXvILkgAlssIg==`，`sw-retire.js` MD5 为 `xviHOEexQQLp0q41sv2uuA==`。证据见 [Git 检查](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/git-checks.txt) 和 [Git blob MD5](../../../.git/t1128-s12-worktree/docs/tasks/T1128-SMOOTH/online-release/sol-s12/git-blob-md5.txt)。
+
